## Models

These classes in the `models` namespace describe the API's data. A JSON request body can be
given as a plain namespace, or as a model instance, `⎕NEW models.{{ models[0].class_name }} args`,
which checks required fields and enum values as it is built. To read a response body into a
model, use `(⎕NEW models.{{ models[0].class_name }}).FromResponse response.Data`.

| Model | Description |
|-------|-------------|
{{~ for model in models ~}}
| `{{ model.class_name }}` | {{ md_cell model.description }} |
{{~ end ~}}
